                  { elem: "angACD", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "angBCD", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "rtCFD",  name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep } ] } },
            { text: "Therefore the three straight lines {DE}, {DF}, and {DG} equal one another.",
